  "description": "Introducing Wild Ranger, a heavy and powerful slab serif font inspired by classic Western posters, vintage rodeo prints, and old-school American typography. Every letter is built with thick strokes, strong square serifs, and a rugged personality that instantly grabs attention.\nThis bold display font is perfect for designers who need a strong, masculine, and timeless look. Whether you are creating a logo, a poster, a t-shirt design, or a product label, Wild Ranger delivers impact and readability even at small sizes.\nPerfect For:\nWestern logos, rodeo posters, barbecue and burger branding, craft beer labels, barbershop signs, sports team apparel, T-shirt prints, badges and emblems, whiskey packaging, farm and ranch branding, book covers, banners, and merchandise.\nAdd a vintage Western touch to your next project with Wild Ranger.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Wild Ranger, a heavy and powerful slab serif font inspired by classic Western posters, vintage rodeo prints, and old-school American typography. Every letter is built with thick strokes, strong square serifs, and a rugged personality that instantly grabs attention.</p>\n<p>This bold display font is perfect for designers who need a strong, masculine, and timeless look. Whether you are creating a logo, a poster, a t-shirt design, or a product label, Wild Ranger delivers impact and readability even at small sizes.</p>\n<p>Perfect For:<br>\nWestern logos, rodeo posters, barbecue and burger branding, craft beer labels, barbershop signs, sports team apparel, T-shirt prints, badges and emblems, whiskey packaging, farm and ranch branding, book covers, banners, and merchandise.</p>\n<p>Add a vintage Western touch to your next project with Wild Ranger.</p>",
